{"reviewId": "434210268_87kKPPlMV", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "\n这段的意思是不是说中国就好像一个落后的学生，对于落后生来说上来就补最难的“最后一道大题”完全没有性价比，需要做的是把那些普通学生已经掌握的基础知识迅速学会并消化，在一张考卷上那些基础分数对于落后生来讲的意义要大于最后一道专属于学霸的大题，因为基础分数是最容易补习也是最容易拿到的分数。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "5491-5560", "abstract": "所以，虽然技术创新更容易被理解为信息技术、生物技术，而对中国更具意义的却是铁路技术、新材料技术，这更符合中国在工业化转型期技术扩散的特征。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "434210268_87kKPPlMV", "userVid": 434210268, "topics": [], "createTime": 1772551060, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 434210268, "name": "y y y", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/nibxxlib1VaPdDcMYRCUfjAC1oarb7O9sn9VnPq2tHKpDUIPZIBevbMLUyFM1cZiauP7ESlZqNPibLI/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 10, "likes": [{"userVid": 24226140, "name": "青山", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-GUX4git4kuMUwsOqCOZfG10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202411-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"reviewId": "434210268_87kKPPlMV", "content": "是的，超级通俗易懂!", "commentId": "434210268_87kKPPlMV_c398422443_89KBlIPXw", "userVid